17
00:00:36.910 --> 00:00:39.600
in Pakistan, I made one in

18
00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:42.460
English... and the same video in

19
00:00:42.310 --> 00:00:42.880
Urdu.

20
00:00:43.420 --> 00:00:44.770
At the Sudanese festival,

21
00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:45.970
I met Asma,

22
00:00:46.040 --> 00:00:47.290
and I asked her...

23
00:00:47.860 --> 00:00:48.730
how can I help?

24
00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:50.350
For the women here,

25
00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:51.870
