26
00:00:52.820 --> 00:00:54.970
Sell more. Save time.

27
00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:56.290
Get seen.

28
00:00:57.070 --> 00:00:59.020
That's what I want to build

29
00:00:58.870 --> 00:01:02.080
